rse learning preferences and geographical locations of participants. Online training offers flexibility and convenience, while offline training provides hands-on experience in a classroom environment."]}, {"heading": "What Our Learners Say", "paragraphs": ["Read their success stories and discover why our training is trusted by aspiring professionals worldwide.", "I recently completed my CCNA Course at GradeSpot IT Solutions and it was an amazing experience! The trainers were highly knowledgeable and made even the toughest concepts easy to understand. The hands-on labs and real-world examples helped me gain confidence in networking. If you’re looking for professional and effective IT training, GradeSpot IT Solutions is the place", "A big thanks to GradeSpot IT Solutions for their excellent SOC Analysis training! The practical approach and supportive trainers made all the difference. Their guidance helped me land a job at Wipro as a SOC Analyst. I Highly recommend GradeSpot to anyone looking to advance their Cybersecurity career!", "recently completed the Cyber Security Professional course at GradeSpot IT Solutions and had a great experience. The trainers are knowledgeable, and the teaching is very hands-on, which made it easy to understand even complex topics", "Learning Cloud in Gradespot IT solutions added so much value to my existing expertise and I am thankful to the tutors of Gradespot who helped me to clear my cloud certifications with their extensive training. I would really suggest Gradespot to the people who want to improve their Technical Skills and start their career in IT.", "I have take the Azure Administrator training from GradeSpot IT Solutions recently, after the training I have cleared my AZ-104 exam successfully. The training was practical with real time examples, and the certification preparation was also completed at the time of training. Thanks to Nikhil Sir and to the whole team of GSIT for such a good training", "A place where one can learn a technical course with a beautiful environment. It''s not an exaggeration but I recommend people to learn things here. A friendly environment for a student. The best thing is that the trainer, supporting staff is the best. I''ve completed my CISCO CCNA 200-301 & AZURE AZ-900 here. They provide good assistance in certification exams also. I would easily and happily recommend this institute.", "I am incredibly grateful for the guidance provided by GradeSpot IT Solutions Private Limited. Thanks to their expert instruction and support, I was able to learn AWS Cloud and achieve my AWS Solutions Architect certification. Their comprehensive curriculum and dedicated trainers made all the difference in my learning journey. Highly recommended!"]}]'::jsonb, image = '/images/courses/ceh.jpg' where slug = 'certified-ethical-hacker-ceh';
update public.courses set sections = '[{"heading": "Digital Marketing", "paragraphs": ["Master digital marketing in just 45 days with GradeSpot IT Solutions and land a job with a guaranteed success rate. Learn from experts, gain hands-on experience, and step into a lucrative career with confidence. Join us now for a transformative journey towards a bright professional future.", "Complete your registration by filling out the form.", "Select an OptionCourse TrainingCertification VoucherOther Queries"]}, {"heading": "Digital Marketing", "paragraphs": ["Unlock the full potential of Digital Marketing with our comprehensive Digital Marketing Course! Gain hands-on expertise in online advertising, social media management, search engine optimization, and more. Learn how to optimize digital marketing strategies, enhance brand visibility, and drive business growth in the digital landscape. Enroll now to become a certified Digital Marketing professional and lead your organization towards digital transformation.", "Empower your learning journey with our engaging live classes.", "Unlock a wealth of knowledge with our extensive collection of recorded videos.", "Get a course completion certification and elevate your skills for success.", "Immerse yourself in practical learning with our hands-on training sessions."]}, {"heading": "Course Overview:", "paragraphs": ["Welcome to our complete Digital Marketing Training Program designed to equip you with the vital abilities and knowledge required to excel within the dynamic field of digital advertising and marketing. Over the direction of forty five days, you will delve into diverse factors of virtual marketing, learning both foundational concepts and superior strategies. Our application is structured to ensure which you not most effective benefit theoretical knowledge however also practical arms-on experience through real-global projects."]}, {"heading": "Key Learning Objectives:", "paragraphs": ["Understand the fundamentals of digital marketing and its significance in the contemporary business landscape.", "Develop proficiency in utilizing various digital marketing channels such as SEO, SEM, social media, email marketing, and content marketing.", "Learn how to create effective digital marketing strategies tailored to different target audiences and business objectives.", "Gain practical experience in using popular digital marketing tools and platforms.", "Enhance your professional credibility and career prospects with a recognized industry certifications.", "Explore analytics and metrics to measure the performance of digital marketing campaigns and derive actionable insights.", "Develop skills in crafting compelling content for digital platforms that engage and resonate with audiences.", "Acquire knowledge of ethical considerations and best practices in digital marketing to maintain credibility and adhere to industry standards."]}, {"heading": "Program Features:", "paragraphs": ["Comprehensive Curriculum: Our Digital Marketing Training Program consists of a complete curriculum designed to equip you with all of the important capabilities and expertise you need to excel in digital advertising and marketing. You will delve into important elements of virtual marketing, which includes SEO, SEM, SMM, content material advertising and marketing, e mail advertising, analytics, and greater. Through palms-on revel in and sensible initiatives, you’ll discover ways to create powerful digital advertising techniques, optimize campaigns, analyze enterprise metrics, and get right of entry to the cutting-edge advancements and equipment in the industry.", "Expert Instructors: Our training program is led by industry professionals with extensive experience in Digital Marketing. They bring their real-world expertise into the classroom, providing valuable insights, practical tips, and best practices. You’ll have the opportunity to learn from the best and interact with instructors who are passionate about helping you succeed in your Digital Marketing journey.", "Hands-on Labs and Projects: To ensure a well-rounded learning experience, our course includes hands-on labs and projects that allow you to apply your knowledge in real-world scenarios. You’ll gain confidence in your abilities by working on practical exercises and projects that simulate the challenges you may encounter as a Digital Marketing Executive. This hands-on approach ensures that you’re well-prepared to tackle any Digital Marketing tasks with ease.", "Enroll in Our Digital Marketing Training Today!"]}, {"heading": "Skills Covered", "paragraphs": ["Search Engine Optimization", "Search Engine Marketing", "Social Media Marketing", "Email Marketing", "Content Marketing", "Campaign Management", "Lead Generation", "Digital Ads"], "style": "cards"}, {"heading": "Enroll in Our Digital Marketing Training Today!", "paragraphs": ["Are you equipped to embark on an interesting career path within the dynamic field of digital advertising and marketing? Enroll in our Online Digital Marketing Training Program and unlock the capability of the digital landscape. Our complete curriculum, led with the aid of expert teachers, and hands-on technique will equip you with the capabilities and confidence to thrive inside the international of digital advertising and marketing. Don’t miss out on this possibility to beautify your career potentialities and come to be an integral asset in the unexpectedly evolving digital enterprise. Join us and pave your way to success in digital marketing!"]}, {"heading": "Tools & Technologies Covered", "paragraphs": ["Show your new skills and earn a certificate. Once you have finished the training, you can sit for the exam. You will receive tasks with instructions that you will need to complete to receive the certificate"]}, {"heading": "Skills To Measure In Digital Marketing Training", "paragraphs": ["A Digital Marketing trainee typically operates within a dynamic team responsible for orchestrating an organization''s online presence and strategy. They collaborate with various stakeholders to execute Digital Marketing initiatives, encompassing areas such as online advertising campaigns, social media management, search engine optimization (SEO), content creation, email marketing, and analytics. Prospective candidates for this Digital Marketing training should possess a strong foundation in online advertising platforms, social media algorithms, SEO techniques, content management systems, email marketing strategies, and data analytics tools."]}, {"heading": "Course Curriculum", "paragraphs": ["Manage device settings and device identity", "Manage guest accountsConfigure self-service password reset", "Create custom role-based access control (RBAC) and Azure AD roles", "Provide access to Azure resources by assigning roles at different scopes", "Manage costs by using alerts, budgets, and recommendations", "Configure network access to storage accounts", "Configure Azure AD authentication for a storage account", "Manage data by using Azure Storage Explorer and AzCopy", "Manage images by using the Azure Compute Gallery", "Move VMs from one resource group to another", "Configure sizing and scaling for Azure Container Instances", "Configure container groups for Azure Container Instances", "Create and configure Azure Container Apps", "Configure storage for Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS)", "Configure scaling settings in an App Service plan", "Create and configure virtual networks and subnets", "Create and configure virtual network peering", "Configure private and public IP addresses", "Create and configure network security groups (NSGs) and application security groups (ASGs)", "Configure an internal or public load balancer", "Configure and use Azure Monitor for networks", "Troubleshoot virtual network connectivity", "Configure monitoring of VMs, storage accounts, and networks by using VM insights", "Perform backup and restore operations by using Azure Backup", "Configure Azure Site Recovery for Azure resources", "Perform failover to a secondary region by using Azure Site Recovery"]}, {"heading": "Our Students works for.", "paragraphs": ["Our students have been employed by some of the top companies in the industry."]}, {"heading": "FAQ''s", "paragraphs": ["Who is eligible to enroll in the Digital Marketing Training Program?", "Our training program is open to individuals from all backgrounds and skill levels. Whether you''re a beginner or an experienced professional looking to enhance your digital marketing skills, our program is designed to accommodate learners at various stages of their career journey.", "Do I need any prior experience or knowledge in digital marketing to join the program?", "No prior experience in digital marketing is required. Our training program is structured to cater to learners with diverse backgrounds. We provide comprehensive instruction starting from the fundamentals, making it accessible for beginners while also offering advanced topics for experienced professionals.", "What learning resources are provided during the training?", "Throughout the program, you will have access to a variety of learning resources including lecture materials, video tutorials, case studies, practical exercises, and supplementary reading materials. Additionally, you''ll have access to digital marketing tools and platforms for hands-on learning.", "How long does it take to complete the Digital Marketing Training Program?", "The duration of the training program is 45 days. During this time, you will cover all the essential topics in digital marketing, gaining both theoretical knowledge and practical skills through hands-on projects and exercises.", "Will I receive a certificate upon completion of the training program?", "Yes, upon successful completion of the Digital Marketing Training Program, you will receive a course completion certificate from GradeSpot IT Solutions. This certificate serves as a testament to your skills and knowledge acquired during the training.", "Is job placement assistance provided after completing the training?", "Yes, we offer job placement assistance to our graduates. Our dedicated career support team provides assistance with resume building, interview preparation, and job placement opportunities within the digital marketing industry.", "How is the training delivered?", "The training is delivered through a combination of live instructor-led sessions, pre-recorded video lectures, interactive workshops, and hands-on practical exercises. Sessions are conducted both online and in-person, providing flexibility for learners to choose the mode of participation that best suits their schedule.", "How can I enroll in the Digital Marketing Training Program?", "To enroll in the program, simply visit our website or contact our admissions team for assistance. You can fill out the enrollment form online and complete the registration process to secure your spot in the upcoming batch of the training program."], "style": "faq"}]'::jsonb, image = '/images/courses/digital-marketing.jpg' where slug = 'digital-marketing';
